// spec/browser/requestGrounding.md, "Story: Open a destination stated in this message"; spec/browser/control.md, "Story: Open an address on the screen I asked from"; spec/browser/control.md, "Story: Offer only the Browser controls my phone negotiated"; spec/browser/remoteControl.md, "Story: Go back, forward or reload only on the tab the turn observed"; spec/browser/control.md, "Story: Tell me a Browser command was sent, never that the page finished"; spec/browser/control.md, "Story: Propose a Browser control in my own words"; spec/browser/control.md, "Story: Tell me you cannot read my page, and never reload it unasked"; spec/browser/arbitration.md, "Story: Follow the browser the person can see"; spec/browser/arbitration.md, "Story: Keep task binding authority on its original browser"; spec/browser/clipboardLease.md, "Story: A copied credential is erased by the command that wrote it"; spec/browser/inference.md, "Story: Send each model call through my account's route with private text removed, and drop stale results"; spec/browser/manualActivity.md, "Story: Ask about manual activity when the browser's record leaves it uncertain"; spec/browser/manualActivity.md, "Story: Let a known harmless form step explain only its own readback"; spec/browser/paymentControl.md, "Story: Distinguish a control that may pay from entry, navigation and other sends"; spec/browser/paymentControl.md, "Story: Ask before guiding the person to a payment control"; spec/browser/websiteGoal.md, "Story: Show a website answer for the entire request with the supporting words"; spec/browser/websiteGoal.md, "Story: Preserve a checked answer while honoring the task's completion and ownership fences"
